# A block that cannot render

`revenu` is not a field in the data section. The block fails, and failing
means an error card that names the block, the code, and the misspelling —
never a blank space where a chart was promised.

```mdv bar
title: Revenue by region
x: region
y: revenu
---
region,revenue
APAC,42100
EMEA,31800
AMER,58400
```

The rest of the document renders regardless.

```mdv bar
title: Revenue by region
x: region
y: revenue
---
region,revenue
APAC,42100
EMEA,31800
AMER,58400
```
